SmartSessionLens::getSessionDigest
├── when called with valid inputs
│   └── it returns non-zero digest
├── when called with different expires
│   └── it returns different digests
├── when called with different lock tags
│   └── it returns different digests
├── when called with different accounts
│   └── it returns different digests
├── when called with same inputs
│   └── it returns same digest
└── when nonce is revoked
    └── it returns different digest